==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Frost Pebblit}}
Frost Pebblits are juvenile [[Frost Talus]]es. They are mainly found in snowy areas, such as the [[Hebra Mountains]] and [[Gerudo Highlands]]. Due to their young age, Frost Pebblits' bodies are light and fragile, leaving them vulnerable to [[Remote Bomb]] blasts. As they mature, Frost Pebblits will toughen up, eventually becoming entirely composed of [[Ice]].<ref name="BotW Hyrule Compendium 2"/>

Due to their coloring, Frost Pebblits often blend in with their surroundings, being somewhat difficult to spot until they become active. Their primary attack is moving toward [[Link]] and attempting to swipe at him with one arm. Coming into contact with one will cause [[Link]] to become frozen for a short period of time. This can be avoided by throwing Remote Bombs from a distance or melting the Frost Pebblit's icy coating with a heat-based [[Weapon]], such as [[Fire Arrow]]s or [[Flameblade]]s. Alternatively, wearing the entire [[Snowquill Set]] will grant Link the [[Unfreezable]] [[Set Bonus]], so long as has been enhanced twice by a [[Great Fairy]]. This allows the Pebblit to be picked up and thrown in order to defeat it. Frost Pebblits will explode when they are thrown or if Link holds them for too long.

